# Replacements for Edit-Color

*plugin* `color-input`

## Insert the expression bar after the color picker

*Description* `Insert the expression bar after the color picker`

*Find* => `colorPickerContent`
```js
$createElement("div", {
  class: "dcg-options-menu-content",
  children: $createElement($ColorPicker, {
    __moreOpts__$
    onColorSelected: this.bindFn(this.handleColorSelected)
  })
})
```

*Replace* `colorPickerContent` with
```js
$createElement("div", {
  class: "dcg-options-menu-content",
  children: [
    $createElement($ColorPicker, {
        __moreOpts__$
        onColorSelected: this.bindFn(this.handleColorSelected)
    }),
    DesModder.insertElement(
      () => DSM.colorInput?.insertColorInput(this.model.id)
    )
  ]
})
```
